OL,3,GNEWSABus strikes to begin over hot
OL,4,Aweather conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus drivers are to press ahead with a
OL,7,Fseries of strikes after rejecting
OL,8,Fattempts to resolve a dispute over
OL,9,Fworking in hot weather, complaining
OL,10,Ftheir cabs often exceed 40C.
OL,12,FAround 1,500 members of Unite working
OL,13,Fin north London and Essex will walk out
OL,14,Ffor four days on Tuesday, followed by
OL,15,Fmore strikes in the coming weeks.
OL,17,FThe strikes, planned by Unite the Union
OL,18,Ffor 11 different occasions between now
OL,19,Fand mid-October, call on Arriva to
OL,20,Freplace air-cooling systems in cabs
OL,21,Fwith full air conditioning.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
